WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 line:92%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.268 line:92%
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.570 line:92%
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.372 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I am doing well,

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:08.108 line:92%
not that anyone ever asks.

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:10.310 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.277 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Biden traveled
to Detroit today,

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.282 size:88% position:44%
but only because someone
asked him about Israel.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:17.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Biden ]
Whoops, I gotta go!

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:19.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
President Biden spoke yesterda

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
with Israeli Prime Ministe
Benjamin Netanyahu

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.057 line:92%
and called for a ceasefire

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:26.226 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the fight between Israe
and Hamas.

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:27.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, good,
if anyone can solve this,

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:31.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's definitely the guy
who can't control his own dog.

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:34.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy said today

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:37.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
