to a 9/11-style commission

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:40.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
to investigate
the January 6th Capitol attack

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:41.541 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And, in similar news,

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:44.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
Derek doesn't want you
to look in his sock drawer

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:47.814 line:92%
