00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:48.348 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:51.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo
announced yesterday

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:54.621 align:start size:94% position:6%
that the state will lift
its social distancing mandates

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:57.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
this week
for fully vaccinated people.

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:58.892 line:92%
Okay, but, you know that's not

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:01.728 size:81% position:41%
