away from you, right?

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:04.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Former New York Mayor
Rudy Giuliani's son

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:08.635
Andrew Giuliani announced hi
run for New York governor toda

00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:11.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
and told reporters,
"It's in my DNA."

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:14.107 line:92%
Also sharing Rudy's DNA --

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:15.508 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
