00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:20.680 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
Former Trump administratio
official Stephen Miller

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:24.951 align:start size:94% position:6%
