in a series of tweets.

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:34.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Yang can sabotage
his own campaign with tweets

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:35.795 size:75% position:38% line:92%
thank you very much.

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:38.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo
yesterday released

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:41.534 size:78% position:39%
