00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:06.126 align:start size:94% position:6%
into a Washington State
deputy sheriff's patrol vehicl

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.060 line:92%
and, now, the Tesla driver

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Johnny Carson ]
