00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.059 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:42.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because, you know,
it's like when you hear your -

00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:45.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
like when you hear yoursel
